    "annotations_dropped": [
      {
        "annotation_id": "d872b35cf0e64e178b270dc035daea9a_15",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "In this case, it is necessary for us to observe that the detention under the PSA of the appellant was revoked by the Union Territory itself which reflects that the Union Territory itself was of the opinion that there was inadequate material"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "3e2481ff95c24c74ad2b4c248f702227_16",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "We say this as, if there was adequate material against the appellant herein which gave rise to the subjective satisfaction of the detaining authority that the appellant would be a clear and present threat to the security of the State if he "
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "a925a98ee8594efea323bc0fb1d0e5b2_17",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "It is also undisputed that not every person detained under the PSA was released during the Covid-19 period."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "6c9d53260efe41df8580e815cd4c4776_18",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\n4. Coming back to the facts of this case, the appellant was thereafter taken into custody once again by the police as stated hereinabove on 18.11.2021 and has been in judicial custody ever since."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "7b484d187279465b93efa3261271748e_19",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "At that time when the order was passed by the learned court below certain prosecution witnesses were already examined."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "9c74161534734b4280d6d33c29eec846_24",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "PRE_RELIED"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "However,\neven in those conditions and circumstances, it would be improper to detain a person or arrest him on a fleeting suspicion alone without any prima facie evidence in support of those allegations against Muzaffar Ahmad Malik vs Ut Th."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "2860b14e23994203b2ec9e9fabf1f5bc_26",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "PRE_RELIED"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "It is possible that the absence of evidence does not necessarily mean that the person so taken into custody is innocent, he may be guilty of those actions suspected against him by the security forces or the State."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "c6fb04d37b6e45f38138e7b2e0513492_27",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The problem arises where the assessment of the State is wrong, and an innocent person is taken into custody based on suspicion."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "7ef9315b926e4e0d9ccac517fbc77860_28",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Such a person who may otherwise be a fence sitter, with nothing to gain or lose from the situation in the Union Territory of JK can tip over to the side of the militants, only on account of a feeling that he cannot get justice from the inst"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "8fb36c5110fe47b98bc03a3ede22ea8e_29",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The situation in which the bureaucracy and the police operate is most unenviable."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "af2556dd519849a7bc03649da6683332_30",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "They are perpetually caught between the devil and the deep sea and errors can be made."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "6c40735e1dd8460a8ccdc6a3e7314730_31",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "It is precisely because of this reason that while dealing with an application for grant of bail the court should at least ask the prosecution as to the availability of prima facie evidence against the appellant/accused to satisfy itself tha"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "e008ab10ae264584ad2c7fa7d1d29b2d_32",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "6. Reverting once again to the purported material against the appellant herein collected by the police during investigation and also on a superficial appreciation of the deposition of witnesses for the prosecution before the Trial Court the"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "0604f1eaa54f4fa6922d83b801a9f065_33",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\n7. The police received an information with regard to presence of the main accused Nissar Ahmad Khanday at village Dood Wagaon along with two other OGWs having food in the house of Mohd Iqbal, upon reaching the village they find that the ma"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "c81d6062a88f4f3897d4af35f125615c_34",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\n8. After the passage of one month, the appellant was taken into custody on the basis of suspicion."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "cbe454fc0776411a967f2c1b6ad36d43_35",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "He was searched and nothing was seized from him."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "012cba6d0eb043868a3beb968b1cf590_36",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The house where they had a meal along with the main accused is also searched, and no recovery is made from there."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "6d8b65bc01714e0c89bd0470d7b89a9f_37",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Subsequently another accused Zahid Ahmad Tantray is arrested and from his possession 20 live rounds of AK47 are seized."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "e6c4aa9316324cefaba06be0b46c7969_38",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "9. It is relevant to mention here said Zahid Ahmad Tantray has already been enlarged on bail (perhaps on default bail as so stated by the learned counsel for the appellant)."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "69e964d0e5d14cf2b80373c77b9a9794_39",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Till date twelve witnesses for the prosecution have been examined before the learned Trial Court."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "b7a880a03a4d400298a02ddfbe3a783b_40",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "None of them have spoken anything incriminating against the appellant."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "7a80047cb134438baa9249c72a4d21ef_41",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "They say that the suspicion on the appellant is on account of information received by the police."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "99dec0d6ef594634bfa80125da090baf_42",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "In fact, PW2 who is Special Police Officer (SPO) Fayaz Ahmad Kumar in his examination-in-chief has stated that he could not identify the accused persons on account of the passage of time."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "c8fa563b7be243a7b9d7dcb4582238cc_43",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "He says on 30.10.2018, he was posted in Police Station, Dooru, on which date a missing report in respect of the main accused of Nissar Ahmad Khanday was lodged in Police Station on which he along with another witness Mohammad Ashraf had gon"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "2609f41a1c1a4efc9a6de9db63da6062_44",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "On cross examination, this witness deposed that he did not know accused Muzaffar Ahmad Malik (appellant herein) and Mohd Iqbal Malik."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "08689db8e7e64a31997a5c3a2d4653e0_45",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "He further says that he neither saw them having any contacts with any terrorist out nor saw them ever possessing any weapon with them nor heard that the said Muzaffar Ahmad Malik and Mohd Iqbal Malik were affiliated with any terrorist outfi"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "bc80fa95239547cebc50e1a09899174a_46",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\nHe also says that he never saw them arrested in the police station."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "5f9dfa0c7bf849cbbd64839ce1658221_47",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "He further states on the cross Muzaffar Ahmad Malik vs Ut Th. Police Station Dooru on 13 March, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/94514037/\n3 examination that he has no knowledge as to why these two persons (appellant herein "
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "27ee5eb6d56f44ebb5d97ff6dd5af148_48",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "This witness has not been declared hostile and neither has he been re-examined by the prosecutor and, therefore, the statement can prima facie be seen as binding the prosecution."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "3c64bac6addb41119df9870c237f1d6f_49",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "11. Similar is the statement of PW-5 SGCT Hardeep Anthar, who identifies the accused shown to him through VC and he says on that day he was posted at Police Station Duroo and that the Dy. SP received an information that some persons were wo"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "f5039fa0c1014f4fbf4bf685c217f197_50",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The OGW's were also helping the main accused to move from one place to another."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "eeda9cf621ba48a8a4ec24b6dbe177d4_51",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "This witness does not state that the appellant was one of those OGW's."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "b7878d1afa4341f5ad271bfc14ea85da_52",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "He further states in his examination-in-chief that the twenty rounds of AK47 were seized from the possession of co- accused Zahid Ahmad Tantray."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "d5fce5285c56495883a449224ceda9d0_53",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "12. On cross-examination, this witness deposed that no arms or ammunition was ever recovered from the possession of accused Nos. 1 & 2 in his presence (appellant and co-accused), and neither was any disclosure statement recorded in his pres"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "bba02f9d332c4ee489f2c89a6514c03b_54",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "He further states that he got his 161-statement recorded after 2  years after the arrest of accused 1 & 2 in the instant case and during that time he has never got his statement recorded anywhere else."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "9e8c7b1f02464ee48a7793906442eeed_55",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Statement of other remaining witnesses do not level any incriminating allegation against the appellant which could raise a prima facie opinion against the appellant."
      },
