            "start": 549,
            "end": 566
          }
        ],
        "text_preview": "Under the circumstances, in view of what has been argued and considered by us hereinabove,\nand the fact that the appellant has been in judicial custody for more than two years and out of 25 witnesses only 12 witnesses have been examined who"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "63eb4405fdc34bbb8aa1dc90204d2fac_60",
